{"id":48597,"date":"2026-02-01T19:54:06","date_gmt":"2026-02-01T18:54:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-das-fogueiras\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:49:17","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:49:17","slug":"corrida-das-fogueiras","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-das-fogueiras\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida das Fogueiras 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida das Fogueiras 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida das Fogueiras 2027<\/strong> (46\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, <strong>26 de Junho de 2027<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica pen\u00ednsula de <strong>Peniche<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Promovida pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Peniche<\/strong> com a gest\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>NativeWarriors<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 uma das mais lend\u00e1rias e carism\u00e1ticas corridas noturnas da Europa, celebrando o solst\u00edcio de ver\u00e3o e as festas dos Santos Populares com milhares de tochas e fogueiras acesas \u00e0 beira-mar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida na <strong>Avenida do Porto de Pesca<\/strong> e consagra\u00e7\u00e3o na <strong>Marina de Peniche<\/strong>, a prova rainha de <strong>15 km<\/strong> arranca \u00e0s <strong>21h30<\/strong>, a caminhada das <strong>Fogueirinhas (5 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>21h45<\/strong> e as provas de <strong>Kids (500m)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>18h00<\/strong>. O percurso circunda toda a pen\u00ednsula pelo m\u00edtico <strong>Cabo Carvoeiro<\/strong> e pelas marginais Norte e Sul sob o aroma das fogueiras tradicionais, premiando todos os atletas com medalha comemorativa exclusiva, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e o inconfund\u00edvel lanche com sardinha assada de Peniche.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; wor